        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.089,
            0.703,
            0.109
          ],
          "content": "(ii) Digital roots → 4, 8, 3, 7, 2, 6, 1, 5, 9; 4, 8, 3; ......"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.111,
            0.575,
            0.133
          ],
          "content": "(iii) Digital roots → 6, 3, 9; 6, 3, 9; ......"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.139,
            0.578,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": "I’m made of digits, each tiniest and odd, No shared ground with root #1—how odd! My digits count, their sum, my root — All point to one bold number’s pursuit— The largest odd single-digit I proudly claim. What’s my number? What’s my name?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.279,
            0.322,
            0.298
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** 11,11,11,111"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.669,
            0.126,
            0.832,
            0.304
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_29_image_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.306,
            0.657,
            0.344
          ],
          "content": "Eleven crore eleven lakh eleven thousand one hudred eleven."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.355,
            0.287,
            0.375
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Page No. 131"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.389,
            0.293,
            0.411
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.42,
            0.845,
            0.458
          ],
          "content": "1. The digital root of an 8-digit number is 5. What will be the digital root of 10 more than that number?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.465,
            0.427,
            0.484
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Digital root is 5 + 1 = 6"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.485,
            0.502,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": "One such number is 40000001"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.509,
            0.433,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": "Try for more numbers."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.538,
            0.848,
            0.595
          ],
          "content": "2. Write any number. Generate a sequence of numbers by repeatedly adding 11. What would be the digital roots of this sequence of numbers? Share your observations."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.602,
            0.424,
            0.62
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Let the number be 10."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.621,
            0.846,
            0.66
          ],
          "content": "The sequence of numbers obtained by repeatedly adding 11 are 10, 21, 32, 43, 54, … ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.203,
            0.661,
            0.57,
            0.681
          ],
          "content": "The digital roots of this sequence are"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.319,
            0.687,
            0.459,
            0.706
          ],
          "content": "10 \\rightarrow 1 + 0 = 1",
          "image_source": "images/page_29_equation_17.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.666,
            0.687,
            0.738,
            0.706
          ],
          "content": "6 5   \\rightarrow   2",
          "image_source": "images/page_29_equation_18.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.322,
            0.707,
            0.46,
            0.725
          ],
          "content": "21 \\rightarrow 2 + 1 = 3",
          "image_source": "images/page_29_equation_19.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.666,
            0.708,
            0.738,
            0.725
          ],
          "content": "7 6   \\rightarrow   4",
          "image_source": "images/page_29_equation_20.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.322,
            0.728,
            0.46,
            0.745
          ],
          "content": "32 \\rightarrow 3 + 2 = 5",
          "image_source": "images/page_29_equation_21.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.665,
            0.728,
            0.738,
            0.745
          ],
          "content": "8 7   \\rightarrow   6",
          "image_source": "images/page_29_equation_22.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.322,
            0.748,
            0.46,
            0.765
          ],
          "content": "43 \\rightarrow 4 + 3 = 7",
          "image_source": "images/page_29_equation_23.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.665,
            0.748,
            0.739,
            0.765
          ],
          "content": "9 8   \\rightarrow   8",
          "image_source": "images/page_29_equation_24.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
